<% content_for :title, "Home AI Telegram Bot" %>
<% content_for :head do %>
  <meta name="google-site-verification" content="sGoHQHIyoxEqwB97Od53S9pOVsNTy9vZGIdW6qReflc" />
<% end %>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-slate-800">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold">Home AI Telegram Bot</h1>

  <p>
    Home AI Telegram Bot is a private household assistant for authorised users.
    Through Telegram, it helps household members manage menus, shopping lists,
    expenses, notes, and calendar events.
  </p>

  <p>
    When a household member connects Google Calendar, the app uses the Google
    Calendar API to read events for schedule questions and daily digests, and to
    create events requested and confirmed by the household. The app does not use
    Google APIs to generate images or create non-consensual intimate imagery.
  </p>

  <p>
    <%= link_to "Privacy policy", privacy_path, class: "text-blue-700 underline" %>
  </p>
</section>
